# Sliding-window fix for the time recyclers in forward_ecg.cpp (Sys2 -fischer
# and Sys3 -fischer3).  Both kept an A-orthonormal basis and evicted its
# OLDEST VECTOR, which is not the same as forgetting the oldest solution.
# Apply on branch cardiac-sim-fakegeo:  git apply asm_bug_demo/fischer_sliding_window.patch
# Rationale + measurements: asm_bug_demo/REPORT_fischer_vm_zh.md,
#                           asm_bug_demo/REPORT_fischer_sys13_zh.md
